<title>UK: Kfw prices 500 mln mark dec 2003 bond, 5.0 pct, 99.</title>
<headline>Kfw prices 500 mln mark dec 2003 bond, 5.0 pct, 99.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond,  anounced earlier by joint lead managers Lehman Brothers (books) and DGZ Bank has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUR WIEDERAUFBAU (KFW)</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.82     PAY DATE   S15.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    99.82     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.175     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
